/**
 * One row per Store. Keys structural, only values historical:
 *   - revenueTax: a single whole-value Timeline<RevenueTax> (windowed {type, deductionType, rate, multiplier}).
 *   - marketingTax: one container per platform { platform, rates: MarketingTaxRate[] }
